  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DEC Ukraine Appeal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing emergency support to people affected by the conflict in Ukraine. Currently working with partners in Poland and Romania to support refugees with the following activities: kits to HH in 5 provinces - Multipurpose cash distributions to 4,400 individuals in Poland- Protection activities - support to GBV survivors and establishing hotlines - Anti-trafficking activities in Romania- Providing essential supplies and information to refugees at border crossing points in Poland and Romania</narrative>
  </description>
